---
layout: base.njk
title: Learning Materials, Platforms and Tools | Scholars Planet
description: Learning platforms, study tools and resources to build skills and prepare stronger scholarship applications. Each card shows whether it is free, free to start or paid.
permalink: /materials/
bodyClass: page-listing
---
{% from "macros.njk" import materialCard %}
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Materials</h1>
    <p>Learning platforms, tools and guides to build skills and prepare stronger applications. Each card shows whether it is free, free to start or paid.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    {%- for group in collections.materials | groupByType %}
    <div class="group">
      <h2 class="group-title">{{ group.type }}</h2>
      <div class="grid">{%- for m in group.items %}{{ materialCard(m) }}{% endfor %}</div>
    </div>
    {%- else %}
    <div class="empty">Materials are being added. Check back soon.</div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
